=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Returns a <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> containing the result of binary XOR on corresponding pairs of bits of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> lhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the bitset on the left-hand side of the operator\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the bitset on the right-hand side of the operator\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>lhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> rhs</span></code></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>lhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">|</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> rhs</span></code></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\